# Kubernetes TLS Configuration for Ingress (Self-Signed Certificate)

This document explains **why and how we create a Kubernetes TLS secret using a self-signed certificate** when configuring HTTPS for an application exposed through **Kubernetes Ingress**.

This setup is commonly used for **local development environments such as Minikube**.

